WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:09.426
Block Battle is falling blocks, but everyone's playing at the same time, and what you clear lands on somebody else. Two to six players.

2
00:00:10.126 --> 00:00:22.988
Everybody stacks on their own board. Move the pieces left and right, rotate them, drop them, and hold one back for later. Keys are shown in the controls, and on a phone, there are on-screen buttons.

3
00:00:23.138 --> 00:00:24.850
Fill a whole row to clear it.

4
00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:32.100
Clear two or more rows at once, or chain combos, and you send garbage rows to a random opponent.

5
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:38.526
The red bar next to your board shows what's coming at you. Clear lines before it lands and you cancel it.

6
00:00:39.226 --> 00:00:43.504
If your stack reaches the top, you're out. Last board standing wins.
